0..72 Comment "// This fixture states a cost model that breaks `Cost.Eff`\'s second law."
73..75 Comment "//"
76..114 Comment "// Two nested charges apply `a` twice."
115..144 Comment "// They then apply `b` twice."
145..194 Comment "// One charge of `plus a b` alternates the costs."
195..227 Comment "// The endpoints do not convert."
228..230 Comment "//"
231..277 Comment "// `Doubled` applies every charged cost twice."
278..335 Comment "// The checker refuses its second law at the declaration."
336..338 Comment "//"
